---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | Foundation"
  description="Eurocert - part of the Eurocert global network since 1998, an independent third-party certification, inspection and testing body headquartered in India."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/foundation/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367863/eurocert/a1.png.png" alt="Eurocert foundation and technical authority policy banner" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]/80"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(212,168,67,0.1)_0%,transparent_55%)]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-16"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Technical Authority</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.25)">Our <span class="text-eurogold-400">Foundation</span></h1><p class="text-white/55 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto heading-font uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] md:text-[11px]">Independent Third-Party Certification Body</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Technical Authority</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Our <span class="text-euro-600">Foundation</span></h2><p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font mt-1">Independent Third-Party Certification Body</p></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Eurocert Inspection Services Pvt. Ltd. is affiliated with Eurocert SA, an accredited Certification Body founded in 1998. With over 25 years of experience, Eurocert SA operates with a National, European &amp; International range of activities across scientific disciplines.</p><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our accreditations demonstrate a commitment to the highest standards of quality and professional excellence. We provide unbiased, objective assessments that help organizations achieve compliance, improve operations, and gain access to global markets.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30 text-center"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2"><i class="fas fa-bullseye text-white text-xs"></i></div><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5">Unbiased Assessment</h5><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs">Independent evaluations</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30 text-center"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-double text-white text-xs"></i></div><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5">Quality Standards</h5><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs">International benchmarks</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30 text-center"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2"><i class="fas fa-globe text-white text-xs"></i></div><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5">Global Recognition</h5><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs">Worldwide market access</p></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[340px] md:h-[440px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367863/eurocert/a1.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Eurocert Accreditations"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/30 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Eurocert Accreditations · Our Journey</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Milestones of Excellence</h2></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/10 hidden md:block"></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 border-2 border-eurogold-400/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-[10px]">98</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg">1998</span><div class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></div></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Foundation Established</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert SA was founded as an Independent Third Party Inspection and Certification Body, marking the beginning of our commitment to excellence.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 border-2 border-eurogold-400/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-[10px]">00s</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg">2000s</span><div class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></div></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">International Expansion</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expanded operations across Asia, Europe, and Africa, establishing ourselves as a trusted certification partner globally.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 border-2 border-eurogold-400/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-[10px]">10s</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg">2010s</span><div class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></div></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Diversified Services</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Added comprehensive services including SMETA audits, GlobalGAP, ISO certifications, and CE marking services across multiple industries.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 border-2 border-eurogold-400/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-[10px]">24</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg">2024</span><div class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></div></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Leading Certification Body</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Today, we stand as one of the most trusted and recognized certification bodies, serving clients across three continents with unwavering commitment to quality.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Recognized Excellence</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Our Accreditation Areas</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-award text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Social Accountability</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">SA 8000, SEDEX/SMETA, Social Compliance protocols for global supply chains.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-seedling text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Food Safety &amp; Agri</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">GlobalGAP, IFS, FSSC 22000, HACCP standards for food chain integrity.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-lock text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Information Security</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">ISO 27001 ISMS and dedicated Data Protection audits to secure organizational assets.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-cogs text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Management Systems</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Core ISO standards including 9001 (Quality), 14001 (Environment), and 45001 (Health &amp; Safety).</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-stamp text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">CE &amp; EU Directives</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">CE Certification, PED, ATEX, and EN standards for unrestricted European market movement.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Sustainability Solutions</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">ISO 14064, Carbon Footprint Assessment, and environmental impact validation.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Worldwide Operations</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Global Presence</h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Eurocert operates with a National, European &amp; International range of activities, providing certification services across multiple continents.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 mb-8"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe-asia text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Asia Region</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Extensive operations across India, China, Bangladesh, and broader Asian markets.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-flag text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Europe Region</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Strong presence with Eurocert SA headquarters and European market expertise.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe-africa text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Africa Region</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Growing operations providing SMETA audits and social compliance services.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">International</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Global recognition facilitating worldwide market access and compliance.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30 text-center"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-1"><i class="fas fa-users text-euro-600 text-sm"></i><h5 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-euro-600 uppercase tracking-widest">Expert Team</h5></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Trained in <span class="font-semibold">India, China, Bangladesh, Bulgaria,</span> and <span class="font-semibold">Italy</span>.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">The Value</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose Accredited Certification</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Trust &amp; Credibility</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Independent verification that your organization meets international standards, building global trust.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-rocket text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Market Access</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Unlocking European, Asian, and international markets by demonstrating compliance integrity.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Continuous Quality</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Identifying improvement areas and enhancing operational efficiency through structured auditing.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-star text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Competitive Edge</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Stand out with internationally recognized certifications that demonstrate compliance excellence.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto"><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Ready to Get <span class="text-euro-600">Certified?</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">Partner with an accredited certification body trusted by organizations worldwide. Contact us to learn how we can help you achieve your compliance goals.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center mb-8"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white bg-euro-600 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-euro-700 transition-all shadow-lg" href="/contact">Contact Us <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-euro-600 border border-euro-200 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-euro-50 transition-all" href="/ce-certification">View Services</a></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-slate-400 text-[10px] heading-font tracking-widest uppercase"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-euro-500"></i><span>Eurocert Inspection Services, Panchkula, Haryana, India</span></div><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-euro-600 heading-font text-sm font-bold mt-3 hover:text-euro-800 transition-colors"><i class="fas fa-phone text-xs"></i> +91 9316012883<span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse ml-1"></span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
